# Private keys must never land in the repo. A vol-diagnostics.key was dropped into
# ./SSH/ on 2026-08-20 while restoring a machine; it was untracked but not ignored,
# so any `git add -A` would have published it. The key belongs in ~/.ssh/.
*.key
*.pem
id_rsa*
SSH/
ssh/
